  "description": "BIGNIU BG-Master: A Full-Suspension Off-Road Electric BikeThe BIGNIU BG-Master is a full-suspension off-road electric bike for riders who want to tackle mountain trails, muddy paths, and steep inclines. It combines 5000W peak power, a 60V / 32Ah battery, and 145Nm of torque for demanding off-road rides.Key Specifications\n\nWhy Choose the BG-Master?The BG-Master is built as an off-road companion for riders who want strong torque and full-suspension comfort on challenging terrain. Its 145Nm torque is designed to help with steep inclines, while the 60V / 32Ah battery provides the listed 29+ miles of electric-mode range.Common QuestionsWhat type of riding is the BG-Master designed for?The BG-Master is designed for off-road riding on mountain trails, muddy paths, and steep inclines.Does the BG-Master have full suspension?Yes. The BG-Master uses a full-suspension system for off-road riding comfort.What is the listed electric range?The listed range is 29+ miles in electric mode.",
